8. `minisvc/__init__.py`, `minisvc/api/__init__.py`, `minisvc/storage/__init__.py` — package markers only; skim last.

## Active runtime code vs simple files
### Active runtime code
- `minisvc/cli.py`
- `minisvc/config.py`
- `minisvc/storage/repo.py`
- `minisvc/api/handlers.py`
